<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
  <title>a1d2.org — link stats</title>
  <style>

    :root {
      color-scheme: light dark;
    }

    html, body {
      margin: 0;
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 100%;
    }
    * {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "PingFang SC", "Noto Sans SC", system-ui, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    }
    body {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 40px 16px;
      font-size: 120%;
    }
    #content {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 46em;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 14px;
    }
    h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 1.6rem;
    }
    .subtitle {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      opacity: 0.7;
    }
    #stats-summary {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      opacity: 0.85;
    }
    ol#stats-list {
      list-style: none;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    ol#stats-list li {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 3rem 1fr auto;
      align-items: baseline;
      gap: 2px 12px;
      padding: 10px 14px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: light-dark(rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.045), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06));
    }
    .rank {
      grid-row: 1 / span 2;
      font-weight: 600;
      opacity: 0.55;
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    }
    .target {
      grid-column: 2;
      word-break: break-all;
    }
    .meta {
      grid-column: 2;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      opacity: 0.6;
    }
    .count {
      grid-column: 3;
      grid-row: 1 / span 2;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    }
    a { color: inherit; }

  </style>
</head>
<body>

<div id="content">
  <h1>Link stats</h1>
  <p class="subtitle">how many times each compressed link has been opened</p>
  <p id="stats-summary">Loading…</p>
  <ol id="stats-list"></ol>
  <p class="subtitle">
    A link is counted when its confirmation screen appears, so pressing Stop still counted.
    Nothing about the visitor is stored — just a running total per link.
    <a href="/q/">← back to the compressor</a>
  </p>
</div>

<script type="module" src="/q/stats.js"></script>
<script type="module" src="https://static.cloudflareinsights.com/beacon.min.js/vce701823e78c4301a35b7e07294d87301792088814092" integrity="sha512-UKNk8GbxkABxKcXYuLkO16EleLGUkcvJWtpSNmExE0Too3ZaFAxTscNWEc1OdAv5/BikHawapSCaiD2XCmp+Bw==" data-cf-beacon='{"version":"2024.11.0","token":"410474eddfbb4154b2d450e8c41421e3","r":1,"spa":2}' crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
</body>
</html>
